CONFIG FILTER RULE INSERT type=filter index=9 state=on action=pass srctarget=any srcif=Leuven-Lab dsttarget=any dstif=internet comment="the implicit any-any allow at the end of the Internet Firewall"
CONFIG FILTER RULE INSERT type=filter index=9 state=on action=pass srctarget=any srcif=remote-users dsttarget=any dstif=internet comment="the implicit any-any allow at the end of the Internet Firewall"
CONFIG FILTER ACTIVATE
CONFIG SLOT UPDATE type=filter slot=9 name=FWShift comment="written by FWShift"
# CONFIG SLOT ACTIVATE type=filter slot=9     <- when the slot has been checked
# Written off (state=off):
#   Finance to ERP: not converted: user groups Finance
#   Prompt for SSH: not converted: action PROMPT: the user is asked on a web page
#   Floating range: not converted: floating ranges Cloud floating
#   Maintenance window: schedule 'SATURDAY,SUNDAY 22:00:00-23:59:00' is not converted; the rule would apply at all times; schedule SATURDAY,SUNDAY 22:00:00-23:59:00 is not converted
#   Teams between sites: not converted: an application column (applications, categories, domains or addresses as applications)
#   Unknown host: references 'host lab-printer': a host that is not in the lookups of the input; 'host lab-printer' holds members only its platform knows
#   Block guest except DNS: not converted: exception dns from one host: source, service (only an exception of one column of addresses or services is cut out)
#   Block anonymizers: not converted: appCategory Anonymizers
#   Plant has no internet: host name object fqdn updates.example.com: written with addresses only
#   HQ web: not converted: domains example.org
#   Isolate unknown sites: not converted: action RBI: remote browser isolation; not converted: customCategory Uncategorized
#   Partner FTP: host name object fqdn ftp.example.net: written with addresses only
#   Block remote users to SMB: not converted: connection origins REMOTE_CLIENT
